cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Data centre sustainable design: 8,760-hour dispatch model, Monte Carlo analysis, validation script, input data and controller study"
abstract: >-
  Code and input data supporting "An Integrated Analytical Framework for
  Sustainable Data Centre Design: CFD-Informed Immersion Cooling, Cryogenic
  Energy Storage, and Quantum-Secure AI Optimisation". Includes the hourly
  dispatch model, the 100,000-draw Monte Carlo analysis, the validation
  script, the NASA POWER and PVGIS input series, and the Q-learning
  controller study.
